  "name": "A Wildcard Hero only turns victorious when it knows Victory Rush",
  "contract": [
    "Every Hero learns Victorious State (32215) with its Defense skill (SkillLineAbility 9577, class mask",
    "512). Its Victorious buff (32216) only enables Victory Rush (34428, 634428, 1134428), so a Hero that",
    "kills without knowing any of them gains nothing, and once it knows Victory Rush a kill makes it",
    "victorious. The explicit flat spawn faces the +X victims. Train sword skill to the level-20 cap and",
    "equip the level-10 Cutlass (851, original 12.705-21.175 damage) so glancing blows against these level-20",
    "enemies still deal damage; the original level-one Worn Shortsword and skill 1 could produce consecutive",
    "zero-damage swings despite high hit and expertise."
  ],
